es/-/1932034","outlet":"Okinawa Times","lang":"ja","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"first_seen":"2026-09-27 08:04Z"},{"title":"台風接近前にやるべきこと 気象防災アドバイザーが教える「3つのポイント」 - 沖縄タイムス＋プラス ニュース","title_en":"Things to do before a typhoon approaches: Three points from a meteorological disaster prevention advisor - Okinawa Times+Plus News","summary":"台風２６号が接近する予報を受けて、気象防災アドバイザーの島尻勝さんは（１）家の外の片付け（２）家の中の対策（３）停電・断水への備え－の３点に、早めに取り組むよう呼びかけている。 屋外で飛ばされそうな物は屋内に片付けるか固定する。雨水があふれて浸水しないよう側溝や排水溝の掃除も必要だ。","summary_en":"In response to the forecast of the approach of Typhoon No. 26, Mr. Katsu Shimajiri, a weather disaster prevention advisor, called for early work on three points: (1) cleaning up outside the house, (2) countermeasures in the house, and (3) preparation for power and water outages. Fix or dispose of objects that may be flown outdoors. It is also necessary to clean side gutters and drains to prevent flooding due to overflowing rainwater.","date":"2026-09-26T23:26","link":"http://www.okinawatimes.co.jp/articles/-/1931551","outlet":"Okinawa Times","lang":"ja","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","via":"RSS","state":false,"first_seen":"2026-09-27 08:04Z"},{"title":"人口減少にどう挑むか 持続可能な経営探る 沖縄公庫、10月2日にフォーラムを開催 - 沖縄タイムス＋プラス ニュース","title_en":"Okinawa Public Bank to hold forum on October 2 to find sustainable management for population decline - Okinawa Times+Plus News","summary":"沖縄振興開発金融公庫（新垣尚之理事長）は１０月２日、「人口構造の変化を見据えた沖縄経済の未来～持続可能な経営モデルへの転換に向けて～」をテーマとした沖縄公庫フォーラム２０２６を開催する。那覇市のロワジールホテル那覇で午後２時から。入場無料。","summary_en":"On October 2, the Okinawa Development Finance Corporation (Chairman Naoyuki Aragaki) will hold the Okinawa Public Finance Forum 2026 under the theme \"The Future of the Okinawa Economy with a Changing Population Structure: Towards a Transition to a Sustainable Management Model.\" From 2:00 pm at Loisir Hotel Naha in Naha City. Admission is free.","date":"2026-09-26T23:25","link":"http://www.okinawatimes.co